The components of the annual report are:
1. the activity report (§ 8);
2. the summary of assets, broken down by suitable criteria taking account of the investment policy (§ 9);
3. the statement of assets, stating the individual assets and, for securities, the securities identification number or the International Securities Identification Number (ISIN) (§ 10);
4. the income and expenditure account (§ 11);
5. the statement of the use of the income of the Sondervermögen (appropriation account, § 12);
6. the statement of the development of the Sondervermögen (statement of changes, § 13);
7. the comparative overview of the last three financial years (§ 14);
8. the statement of the transactions concluded during the reporting period that are no longer included in the statement of assets; for securities, the securities identification number or the ISIN must be stated where possible, and for real estate Sondervermögen and special Sondervermögen with investments in real estate or real estate companies, the purchases and sales of real estate made and the holdings in real estate companies must be stated in an annex under § 247(1) sentence 2 of the Kapitalanlagegesetzbuch;
9. the notes, containing the following information:
a) the information required under the Derivateverordnung;
b) the information under § 16;
c) in the case of an AIF:
aa) the information on remuneration to be stated under § 101(3) sentence 1 points 1 and 2 of the Kapitalanlagegesetzbuch and the information on material changes to be stated under § 101(3) sentence 1 point 3 of the Kapitalanlagegesetzbuch;
bb) the information to be stated in addition under § 300(1) to (3) of the Kapitalanlagegesetzbuch;
d) all other information necessary to understand the annual report;
10. the reproduction of the special auditor's note on the result of the audit of the annual report of the Sondervermögen.
Sentence 1 point 9 letter (c) double letter (bb) does not apply to open-ended domestic special AIFs in so far as the fund rules provide for the disclosure of that information in another way.

